int":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/astrology-framework.md","start_line":1,"end_line":56}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-1b102259e5354392b4b17af8fc53e477","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"references/bazi-framework.md","start_line":1,"end_line":88},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill content is entirely in Chinese and provides no indication that the user can choose another language or receive a translated response. This can exclude users who do not read Chinese, cause misunderstanding of guidance, and reduce informed consent about how the skill will respond, though it does not appear malicious in this context.","remediation":"Add an explicit language-selection step or fallback behavior at the start of the skill, such as asking the user for a preferred language or stating that the framework is available in Chinese by default with translation on request. Provide multilingual metadata or a brief bilingual header so users understand the language constraint before relying on the skill.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/bazi-framework.md","start_line":1,"end_line":88}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-0dac2a0af2874ed6a07eb7258f30f27d","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.85,"location":{"file":"references/chinese-methods.md","start_line":1,"end_line":1},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file presents the skill entirely in Chinese from the title onward, and nowhere indicates that the user can choose another language or that the skill is intentionally limited to a Chinese-speaking audience. Under the policy rule for natural-language violations, forcing a specific language without opt-in can be a locale-policy issue.","remediation":"Document that the skill is intended only for Chinese-speaking users with a clear justification, or add an explicit language-choice/alternate-language option in the skill description.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/chinese-methods.md","start_line":1,"end_line":1}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-97babb205cf0450499c8d1b619f5c012","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"references/dao-mysticism-framework.md","start_line":1,"end_line":58},"finding":null,"explanation":"The entire skill guidance is written as prescriptive Chinese-language output style, including required phrasing and tone, with no indication that users may choose another language. Under the policy, forcing a specific language without user opt-in is a natural-language policy violation.","remediation":"State that Chinese is the default only when the user requests it, or explicitly allow responses in the user's preferred language. Add a note that the style guidance applies regardless of language, rather than requiring Chinese output.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/dao-mysticism-framework.md","start_line":1,"end_line":58}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-baa39332e0794f8c940f83c94f4192c6","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"references/fengshui-and-timing-framework.md","start_line":1,"end_line":114},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file contains user-facing instructions exclusively in Chinese, and there is no indication that users may choose another language or that the skill is intentionally limited to a Chinese-speaking audience. Per the policy, forcing a specific language without user opt-in is a natural-language policy violation.","remediation":"Add a clear note that the skill is intended only for Chinese-language use, or provide multilingual support / a user language selection mechanism. If the Chinese-only scope is intent