y natural-language comments, identifiers, error text, and command-line output, including the module description and user-visible strings. Under the policy rule for natural-language constraints, this is a locale-specific language choice without any opt-in or explanation that the skill is intentionally limited to Chinese-speaking users.","remediation":"Document that the skill is explicitly Chinese-locale specific, or add bilingual/user-selectable output and messages for non-Chinese users. If Chinese-only behavior is intended, state that constraint clearly in the skill documentation or interface.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"scripts/jieqi.js","start_line":3,"end_line":4}]},{"id":"SDI-4","finding_id":"finding-06bd835b002344ad9e682a7b0375e251","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"scripts/profile.js","start_line":480,"end_line":480},"finding":null,"explanation":"The usage text at L480 says `node profile.js show <userId> 显示完整档案`, which communicates full-profile output. In the actual implementation, `showProfile` defaults to masked output and only reveals full data when `--full` is present, as shown at L249-L271. This is an active documentation/behavior contradiction rather than a mere omission.","remediation":"Update the help text to state that `show` displays a masked profile by default and requires `--full` for full details. Consider also reflecting this in all related usage strings for consistency.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"scripts/profile.js","start_line":480,"end_line":480}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-7e0ce1bd27ab49cabaeed623a104e876","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.87,"location":{"file":"scripts/push-toggle.js","start_line":84,"end_line":84},"finding":null,"explanation":"The cron job is 